course: dictionary
lesson: 12586
title: One word, many meanings: directed
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Directed is the past form of the verb direct. It can mean told someone the way, or told people what to do. «The police officer directed the cars around the broken bus.» The officer was telling drivers which way to go, so directed means guided or told.
explain: Look at the words around it to find which meaning fits. «The question was directed at me» uses directed in a different way: it means aimed or pointed at someone. Nobody is giving directions there; the question was aimed at one person.
explain: Directed is also a maths word. «-7 is a directed number» means the number has a minus sign, which shows it goes below zero. Always try your meaning in the sentence: if it still makes sense, you have got it.
fact: Directed is the past form of direct: direct, directs, directed, directing.
fact: «Directed» can mean told someone the way, or told people what to do.
fact: «Directed at» means aimed or pointed at someone or something.
fact: A person who directed a film was in charge of making it.
fact: In maths, a directed number has a + or − sign to show which way it goes.
exercise: «The police officer directed the traffic around the broken bus.» What does directed mean here? | *Told the drivers which way to go | Painted the bus red | Fell asleep next to the bus | Ran away from the bus
exercise: «The question was directed at me.» What does directed mean here? | Hidden from me in a box | Told me the way to the shop | *Aimed or pointed at me
exercise: «She directed the school play last term.» What does directed mean here? | Was the youngest actor in the play | *Was in charge of making the play | Sat in the front row | Sold tickets at the door
test: «The coach directed the team to the far end of the pitch.» What does directed mean? | Kicked the ball away | Put the team to sleep | Cheered for the other team | *Told the team where to go
test: In «-7 is a directed number», what does the minus sign show? | It means you must add it up | The number is very big | The number is a fraction | *Which way the number goes, below zero
exam: «Follow the instructions as directed on the box.» What does as directed mean? | Throwing the box away | Doing it with a friend | *Doing exactly what the instructions say | Reading it upside down
